" Minimal init for the real-machine CI E2E job. Exercises the genuine
" plug.vim → PlugInstall chain (plus apply's plugged-dir assertion) with a
" single tiny plugin — never the 17-plugin production .vimrc with its
" composer hook. Linked to ~/.config/nvim/init.vim by e2e/apps.ci.yaml.
call plug#begin('~/nvim/plugged')
Plug 'tpope/vim-commentary'
call plug#end()
